    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382460/extras/46bb1ea79d0df15bdec4301d4f5846e1.poster.avif?t=1753617097\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382460/extras/46bb1ea79d0df15bdec4301d4f5846e1.webm?t=1753617097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382460/extras/46bb1ea79d0df15bdec4301d4f5846e1.mp4?t=1753617097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descent is a co-op survival horror game centered around an ever-changing environment, where a party of up to 4 (four) players need to complete objectives and make use of stealth to escape and further progress their story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover your true identity as you descend deeper into this world. The more you progress, the more the world remembers\u2026 and the more it resists.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382460/extras/46bb1ea79d0df15bdec4301d4f5846e1.poster.avif?t=1753617097\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382460/extras/46bb1ea79d0df15bdec4301d4f5846e1.webm?t=1753617097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382460/extras/46bb1ea79d0df15bdec4301d4f5846e1.mp4?t=1753617097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descent is a co-op survival horror game centered around an ever-changing environment, where a party of up to 4 (four) players need to complete objectives and make use of stealth to escape and further progress their story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover your true identity as you descend deeper into this world. The more you progress, the more the world remembers\u2026 and the more it resists.</p>",
